    "## 14. Validaciones (balance de N, ODE gap, monotonía)\n",
    "\n",
    "Tres invariantes que el solver debe cumplir para considerarse correcto:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Balance de N total**: $|N_{total}^{final} - N_{total}^{inicial}| < 0.01\\ gN/L$.\n",
    "2. **ODE gap por construcción**: $\\max\\,|cdot_{coll} - CDOT| < 10^{-10}$.\n",
    "3. **Monotonía de sustratos**: $G(t)$, $F(t)$ no crecen; $E(t)$, $X(t)$ no decrecen en lag/growth."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def validate(result: dict, tol_n: float = 1e-2, tol_gap: float = 1e-9) -> dict:\n",
    "    sdf = result[\"states_df\"]\n",
    "    Nfree = sdf[\"N_free_gN_L\"].to_numpy()\n",
    "    Nrec  = sdf[\"N_rec_gN_L\"].to_numpy()\n",
    "    Prot  = sdf[\"Prot_g_L\"].to_numpy()\n",
    "    aa_cols = [c for c in sdf.columns if c.startswith(\"AA_\") and c.endswith(\"_mmol_L\")]\n",
    "    N_in_aa   = PARAMS[\"MW_N\"] * sdf[aa_cols].sum(axis=1).to_numpy() if aa_cols else np.zeros_like(Nfree)\n",
    "    N_in_prot = PARAMS[\"Y_N_FROM_PROT\"] * Prot\n",
    "    N_total   = Nfree + N_in_aa + N_in_prot + Nrec\n",
    "    n_err     = float(abs(N_total[-1] - N_total[0]))\n",
    "\n",
    "    G = sdf[\"G_g_L\"].to_numpy(); F = sdf[\"F_g_L\"].to_numpy()\n",
    "    E = sdf[\"E_g_L\"].to_numpy(); X = sdf[\"X_gDW_L\"].to_numpy()\n",
    "    mono_G = bool(np.all(np.diff(G) <= 1e-6))\n",
    "    mono_F = bool(np.all(np.diff(F) <= 1e-6))\n",
    "    mono_E = bool(np.all(np.diff(E) >= -1e-6))\n",
    "    mono_X = bool(np.all(np.diff(X) >= -1e-6))\n",
    "\n",
    "    gap_ok = result[\"max_ode_gap\"] < tol_gap\n",
    "    n_ok   = n_err < tol_n\n",
    "\n",
    "    return dict(\n",
    "        N_total_initial = float(N_total[0]),\n",
    "        N_total_final   = float(N_total[-1]),\n",
    "        N_balance_error = n_err,\n",
    "        N_balance_ok    = n_ok,\n",
    "        ODE_gap_max     = result[\"max_ode_gap\"],\n",
    "        ODE_gap_ok      = gap_ok,\n",
    "        monotonicity_G  = mono_G,\n",
    "        monotonicity_F  = mono_F,\n",
    "        monotonicity_E  = mono_E,\n",
    "        monotonicity_X  = mono_X,\n",
    "    )\n",
    "\n",
    "report = validate(smoke)\n",
    "for k, v in report.items():\n",
    "    print(f\"  {k:18s}: {v}\")"
